The SVG icons in this directory are copied from the GNOME adwaita-icon-theme
project (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme) and are not
covered by OpenEmux's MIT license.

They are distributed under the terms of either the GNU Lesser General Public
License v3 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html) or the Creative
Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 United States License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/us/), at your option.

They are bundled so that the OpenEmux UI renders its symbolic icons even on
hosts whose icon theme does not provide these names.
